OL,3,GNEWSACould free theatre in schools help
OL,4,Aaccess to arts?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome children are missing out on
OL,7,Fopportunities to experience live
OL,8,Ftheatre because of cost and other
OL,9,Fbarriers, arts leaders have said.
OL,11,FThe team at Bristol Old Vic believe
OL,12,Faccess to theatre and creative arts has
OL,13,Freached an "emergency" point for some
OL,14,Fyoung people, with those from less
OL,15,Faffluent backgrounds often less likely
OL,16,Fto attend performances.
OL,18,FNow the city centre theatre is taking
OL,19,Ffree productions directly into Bristol
OL,20,Fsecondary schools in an effort to reach
OL,21,Fpupils who might otherwise miss out.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
