OL,3,GNEWSACould free theatre in schools help
OL,4,Aaccess to arts?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are really trying to take theatre
OL,7,Fto everyone across the city and across
OL,8,Fthe kind of barriers that people might
OL,9,Fface," said engagement director Lucy
OL,10,FHunt.
